keys ALWAYS
- quit f10 ctrl+q
- toggle HIDDEN ctrl+t
- refresh ctrl+r

keys LEFT_PANEL
- LEFT_VIEW f3
- LEFT_EDIT f4
- LEFT_COPY f5
- LEFT_MOVE f6
- open LEFT_NEW_DIR f7
- LEFT_DELETE f8 delete

keys RIGHT_PANEL
- RIGHT_VIEW f3
- RIGHT_EDIT f4
- RIGHT_COPY f5
- RIGHT_MOVE f6
- open RIGHT_NEW_DIR f7
- RIGHT_DELETE f8 delete

panels
- LEFT border single
- RIGHT border single
- OUTPUT border single fg grey
- MENU.selected fg black bg cyan
- KEYBAR fg black bg cyan

logs
- OUTPUT.stderr fg red
